# Commit and push finished work

After a requested code change is implemented and checked, commit it and push the current branch. Do this without waiting for a separate commit request.

Skip the commit and push only when the user said beforehand to leave the change local, or when the change is still unfinished. Do not commit secrets or local `.env` files.
